{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>【ACGHK 2026】首次參展的Nintendo Switch專賣店「Assemble」攤位報導！斯普拉遁塗擊隊、DQ等經典名作週邊琳瑯滿目</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/278ebc667b6aaaf6776cf6e0ad5a5f05027b0b1e0d11ad7ccb2736dce51e31aa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F7a73af01eae2afd7295d0a1025e8c7c5\"/><p>於2026年7月24日(五)至28日(二)舉辦中的「 ACGHK 2026 」，全稱「Ani-Com &amp; Games Hong Kong 2026(香港動漫電玩節2026)」 本次為大家帶來Nintendo Switch專賣店「 Assemble 」攤位的現場報導！</p><h3>「Assemble」攤位報導！斯普拉遁塗擊隊、DQ等經典作品週邊琳瑯滿目</h3><p>Assemble攤位</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6ac2e7139bd57cbff9ab6d97716070aa4a9cd6689dddd38ec9b7c90094cfc2f9/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F2a98396bc87e695322073a77819160fa\"/><p>首次參展ACGHK、以Nintendo Switch為主軸販售多款遊戲及相關週邊的「Assemble」 CAPCOM、SEGA、Cygames等豪華廠商齊聚一堂，連日吸引大量粉絲，場面盛況！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6db66161ab3892b4b99eef80accbb9d067ec173626276f265197515ca6c19dc7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Ff08489101dee3ce05cab6fd95b30a29a\"/><h3>斯普拉遁 塗擊隊</h3><p>斯普拉遁 塗擊隊</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2cb638d689e3705c739bc112bd3cda9b8b418c33ab45392688ce3d856561667d/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F020b85c816d02d0c2dc11b72716187e8\"/><p>2026年7月23日(四)發售的Nintendo Switch 2遊戲「斯普拉遁 塗擊隊」 支援最多4人連線遊玩，攤位現場亦設試玩體驗。</p><p>手掌般的大小，超可愛！！！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5ded6845ce87f0775a23ce2dd832c900a2a81a60584d6c08359339d3804a33b3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fce3d735e2681d295f0e8dd6fbeadc58d\"/><p>絨毛玩偶吊飾及濺墨炸彈登場。 一字排開的樣子超可愛！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/33aec594d07f4ca40ce49057fc2b9caf6eddc5b6063f8007d5f86a3aa84c17fa/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fafef1913a67d2c0080823563a2392e10\"/><p>魷魚和章魚以不同顏色展示。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/035c281dc1fa518b5c0af4c5afd846baaa73be924179bff4ec5f9e5c262136f4/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F43739b71a7fe71b5b6942f305facac34\"/><p>「斯普拉遁 塗擊隊」相關週邊一同展示！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/600adac270df95df103a130dae3488fd5fa23eafad2d6f60522bf1297e368126/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F832446203fce4ddb48edd501a6df3751\"/><p>斯普拉遁系列在香港也非常受歡迎。</p><h3>SQUARE ENIX</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4b71c0d4e511720ed428dc098ff1f71bc6f512e615262f271f3e2532412baaae/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F63f7997d691b54ad810f3295a4ba0605\"/><p>迎來40週年的「勇者鬥惡龍」系列。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4f9ec8336ab5e30ba824b1ca29687318d2a9d820f58a33c0cceea5af4ad2875e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F016bc3860a0c3089218835a6ceb06fbd\"/><p>腦中不由自主響起那首熟悉的開場曲……。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2c6ef852cb67fa0c7a2e8739774ea83dc0974c692fdec324efbb8e3862f86311/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F982f1846a3153b2230e0623b4141668d\"/><p>場內準備了多種週邊商品。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3355fc8f41a1373a6d367df1c0bd7b7d73cd9dd727b09201c285de04eb1543d8/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc2c64c25ffc163058db906c3a6c38bfd\"/><p>「FINAL FANTASY」系列的週邊也有。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/92a8c8b30d284e48fc047807d08eebf5bf3b45b9305ca9eefbf77d5060de2075/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F739a5d20ad579f3cacd429d64c9f314a\"/><p>光是欣賞就已經令人興奮的陣容呢。</p><h3>SEGA / ATLUS</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/e154c4d83c742d1a5c722803c3416fac3445097229cc554f3b88015d8e729444/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F038cfb0296133db034911832d9081579\"/><p>今年迎來35週年的「音速小子」系列陣容</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/dfd1437175b2406935ea8dc16c7203ee2d334eeff76428a4648c3766d4f321d7/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1e604348e853b25218165b809e1b32fe\"/><p>不僅有音速小子，還發現了紅色帥氣的「納克魯斯」！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/98ae69999ce7218e8c4b20958b7e4710c4fa7601383b728afa82a67706f72a3b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F4dba34e71135d1681a752ff28396cbcf\"/><p>用SEGA LOGO的絨毛玩偶表達愛意！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/545ed7982dbc88829034e93bb08e27e0a4cddb963d56f14b7aa60f3d3ed8c001/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F46d963c8cb3647bbd4a03bff56453da1\"/><p>還有「人中之龍」系列，以及……</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/4d5ba3e978b779f653d4940ec3ab33c5b485ff9455e6b90f383df2c5768dba6b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F779d993b87a5639bbe746ff69498f9d2\"/><p>「女神異聞錄3 Reload」的週邊也有陳列。</p><h3>Cygames</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/2bd32a043b76ebb7b2783979a5480d60699ef1c4e001255a7d2fdd1fe41c20f3/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F70c95184e153b7d560bdc61162ce191e\"/><p>而Cygames則陳列了「賽馬娘 Pretty Derby」相關週邊。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b458099202ac739afe794a84ddc95d03cac592b343a8b67e4a9e950bbd97377a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc127d7f6a8ec2e3d08a873439d3ea2ea\"/><p>你的愛馬……(きみの愛馬が)！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/234fc30e5ad087273e0070f1bdbcaaf4ea0262d82a797ccce552c6611f5c934b/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9dd9958d7d1d5e42b837a54fb542ea6c\"/><p>「碧藍幻想」及「巴哈姆特之怒」等週邊也有販售！</p><h3>CAPCOM</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/5c9ce42f8510e5f4bf5ab74a92563d7cb80d6a83375f93f18ac57bf6b8b2777e/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fec9d3e122687caa9e718dae580db0f75\"/><p>當然還有CAPCOM的專區！</p><p>徽章</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/6fc91ac5769b1a5f6b36d1e8b18f9172900c57f825951f67c3cbf287aff9f17c/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fe13f9807a40ea1afb8aa28ddf471a295\"/><p>「PRAGMATA」週邊等以會場限定特別價格販售。</p><p>CAPCOM週邊一應俱全！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/3ff76882caf8e8edb36241ff10199a8c68273039a71cf3c41627752bf29bb9ae/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F65ef7cafbdfb3d7531f97368cdebd383\"/><p>「快打旋風」及「魔物獵人」的週邊，還有卡普空吉祥物也都有販售！</p><h3>寶可夢</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/9313693adb857af685932268ea72b1d8f0e33fd2fe78654a58bffefb04623374/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F6f58c0391653dee0f2c1f48ea10cf96a\"/><p>說到任天堂，當然少不了超人氣的「寶可夢」專區！</p><p>百變怪的存在感超強！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/b9ac61544b6757d1b049f2cbf63bdf8e95a2394e60dcbf1c1151477ac0a5e75a/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2Fc02912ce1ace7613be0fb2d178217636\"/><p>在「Pokémon Pokopia」中首次擔任主角的百變怪。</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/47533339d51e647a71b480731166451a2d5a8b71cb67954abe2f904b25580e07/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F64cee369072608557b1294f402d31029\"/><p>大量寶可夢一字排開。 令人忍不住想大喊「Pokémon GET DAZE！」的陣容！</p><h3>9 R.I.P. sequel</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/945da580ef6aba54354bb342fa949dafd0893c9eba5d923bc652ea5040a82cfc/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F9caaebaf706f71ffec85949b82d70c53\"/><p>往攤位深處前進，發現了續作乙女遊戲「9 R.I.P. sequel」的展示！ 「引導你走向幸福——」般的宣傳標語，牢牢抓住了乙女遊戲玩家的心！</p><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a2871b082574b35a6e6d41a333121afeabd783d12ecafc641159c86a689bee87/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F8f4ca1fa5e9140f80489753d8aff5530\"/><p>隨機徽章及角色票券風卡面收藏等也有販售。</p><h3>Nintendo Switch遊戲實體版販售</h3><img src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/a3cb3ee6db26754714b42a6777b294fcfb21e34f2f69da78230e6f5a183d89ee/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960;quality_80;format_webp/https:%2F%2Fmedia.zenfs.com%2Fen%2Fsaiga_nak_871%2F1eb26fe044bfab42547822cd7ac9a978\"/><p>Nintendo Switch遊戲的實體版也有販售。</p><p>以上，便是經典作品週邊齊聚一堂、看點滿滿的「Assemble」攤位報導！</p><p>🔸官方節目「魔法氣泡 魔法時間 #10」確定於 7 月 29 日 19:30 播出！觀看後還可獲得《魔法氣泡!! Quest》遊戲內道具特典 🔸31冰淇淋所推出的「31寶可夢夏日！活動」將次8月1日起開跑！將推出展現皮卡丘特色的聯名口味等新品 🔸Nintendo Switch 2版「FINAL FANTASY XIV」確定於8月4日發售！現正接受預購中、期間限定30%折扣亦實施 🔸Ginza Cozy Corner推出「Pokémon Pokopia」迷你蛋糕！還有以百變怪為靈感的蛋糕 🔸任天堂 Switch Online 會員限定活動「統一試玩」中，「Minecraft Dungeons」可無限暢玩！活動期間為 7 月 27 日至 8 月 2 日</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-27T09:58:40.588722+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1570,"images":30,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none"}}